  "label": "conj:rho-k-pair-gen-canonical-form",
  "kind": "conjecture",
  "title": "Conjectural canonical form of the pair-gen piece $\\rho_K^{\\text{pair-gen}}$ in the graded $\\rho_K$ expansion: there exists a closed-form Wedderburn-coupled functional form $f_2(q, \\hat V_i, \\hat V_j)$ such that $\\rho_K^{\\text{pair-gen}} = \\sum_{i<j} f_2(q, \\hat V_i^{\\text{full}}, \\hat V_j^{\\text{full}})$ recovering the six-term theorem's Kashaev limit at sub-percent accuracy.",
  "uses": [
